Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 01:58:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 430/488] [DS4.1] The CED decoder's token metadata in one
 TileLang launch

decoder_metadata gathered the positions, request ids, slots and cache
lengths at the CED indices one field at a time and set the -1 sentinels
with a negation and three masked fills: ten torch launches each time a
prefill builds a decoder's metadata. One kernel now writes all four, the
sentinels at negative indices and gather_rows' zero past the step's
rows included. Tested against the torch chain.
